        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_of_the_Pines%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake of the Pines is a gated residential community that loops a golf course around its reservoir.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_of_the_Pines%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lake of the Pines was laid out by property developers in the 1960s, forming a planned community.",
